1
00:00:43,231 --> 00:00:46,555
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 8=

3
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:56,400
Then tell me if this is a dream.

4
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:19,760
You really don't remember?

5
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,920
Fine, I'll stop teasing you.

6
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,920
What a fool.

7
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:49,280
You ungrateful traitor!

8
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,880
Did you forget

9
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,560
who's paying to keep your mother alive?

10
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:56,960
Go on.

11
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:11,760
False imprisonment,

12
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:12,960
intentional assault,

13
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:16,040
and attempting to force Gu Xiaotang
into high-risk surgery.

14
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,040
We have all the evidence.

15
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,160
The police will arrive soon.

16
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:20,160
What did you say?

17
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,400
Forcing her into surgery?

18
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:24,000
Look, she's perfectly fine.

19
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,400
Does she have a single scratch?

20
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,080
As for you...

21
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,920
Come on, get up.

22
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,280
Get up.

23
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,720
Now, tell them.

24
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,360
Did I force you?

25
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,680
Did I do this to you?

26
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:42,320
No, I did it on my own.

27
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,480
Xiaotang, please.

28
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,000
Don't mind me. Just go.

29
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,720
Gu Xiaotang, we're even on this.

30
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,320
But don't forget

31
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,240
we're still in the same boat.

32
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,360
If the wedding dress issue
isn't settled,

33
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,680
neither of us will end well.

34
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,760
You better watch yourself.

35
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Mei, it's okay now. Don't be scared.

36
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,840
Xiaotang,

37
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,040
I'm sorry.

38
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,520
My mom is sick.

39
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,920
The company covers her medical bills.

40
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,200
With the interest piling up,

41
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,640
I really can't pay it back.

42
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,640
I know.

43
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,920
They did the same to me.

44
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,800
That's why I endured them for so long.

45
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,920
See?

46
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,360
That's how they operate.

47
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,840
Even if we ruin the wedding,

48
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,560
without crushing
those scumbags for good,

49
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,240
they'll never let us off.

50
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,360
So what are you going to do?

51
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,720
I want to go all in.

52
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,760
But this time is different.

53
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,080
I have a new script.

54
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,120
I'm putting on a whole new show.

55
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:08,520
Director Li, I was being foolish before.

56
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,280
I've come to my senses.

57
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,760
Only by marrying Lu Qingyuan
and getting his money

58
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,200
can I finally break free.

59
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,360
I'll do my best
to cooperate with the sponsor.

60
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,720
I'll wear the dress.

61
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,600
There you go.

62
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,920
If you'd done so earlier,

63
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,160
- you wouldn't have suffered so much.
- Right.

64
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:27,080
I'll have the doctor prepare
for surgery.

65
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,800
Wait, Director.

66
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:33,440
The surgery is too risky,
and recovery takes too long.

67
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:36,200
It might mess up
my look for the wedding.

68
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,520
I've been on a strict diet lately.

69
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,560
Maybe I can try fitting into it again.

70
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,960
That saves on the surgery fees.

71
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:46,040
Fine, I'll give you one more chance.

72
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,480
If it still doesn't fit,

73
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,240
don't blame me then.

74
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,480
By the way,

75
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:58,560
could you invite Lu Qingyuan
and Xia Na over?

76
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,120
Lu Qingyuan is your fiance.

77
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,440
It makes sense to invite him,

78
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,480
but why Xia Na?

79
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,040
She's my best friend.

80
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,160
I believe in her judgment.

81
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,600
Fine, I'll call her.

82
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:40,080
Xiaotang.

83
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,600
You're making me worry.

84
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,640
Gu Xiaotang.

85
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:47,320
Rumor has it you refused to wear
the sponsored wedding dress

86
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,720
because you're not marrying Mr. Lu.

87
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,720
Is that true?

88
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:52,840
Nonsense! Xiaotang and I are rock solid.

89
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,880
Please don't believe those rumors.

90
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:58,320
Besides, Xiaotang and I
are getting married soon.

91
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:01,400
I'll let Xiaotang do whatever she wants.

92
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,400
Look over here.

93
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,920
(Stay calm, Gu Xiaotang.)

94
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,400
(Don't slap him yet. Control yourself.)

95
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,200
Lu Qingyuan is so accommodating

96
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:17,480
that he can even overlook my mood swings

97
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,160
and my past caprices,

98
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,560
all just to make this wedding happen.

99
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,120
But Lu Qingyuan,

100
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:28,120
you promised to give me
my freedom and my dignity

101
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,120
after the wedding.

102
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,440
Can you really do that?

103
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:35,080
Xiaotang, what are you talking about?

104
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:37,320
When have I ever
broken a promise to you?

105
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,680
We're getting married soon.

106
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:43,160
I'll give you whatever you want.

107
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,680
I'm relieved.

108
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:50,520
Alright, stop trying to be so tough.

109
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,840
As a woman,
you should learn to rely on men.

110
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:54,840
Then you would live easier.

111
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,560
Rely on men?

112
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,120
You mean,

113
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,960
relying on you to cause problems,

114
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,440
or relying on you

115
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:07,240
to solve the problems you caused?

116
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,680
I'm a little tired.

117
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,400
I'll go get some rest.

118
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,920
Honey, get some good rest.

119
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,360
Look over here, Gu Xiaotang.

120
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:36,120
Xiaotang, you look super gorgeous today!

121
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,280
I knew it.

122
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,960
You and Lu Qingyuan
are a match made in heaven.

123
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:43,120
But this wedding dress

124
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,760
doesn't really suit you.

125
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,920
It makes sense.

126
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:50,840
After all, it looks
a bit too expensive on you.

127
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:53,640
Maybe something cheaper
would suit you better.

128
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,960
Thanks for the compliment, Xia Na.

129
00:07:57,160 --> 00:08:00,080
But I really should learn from you.

130
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,720
About what?

131
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,560
Learn how

132
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:08,760
you nailed your unique taste.

133
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,240
Like this outfit you're in.

134
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,720
It is last year's style,

135
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,640
and the color is a bit...

136
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:20,200
But it surprisingly fits you.

137
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,080
Besides,

138
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:25,520
even foundation can't
hide your dark circles.

139
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:28,680
I know you're stressed over my wedding,

140
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,240
but you should take care of your skin.

141
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:34,800
After all, living off
your looks isn't easy.

142
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:52,920
Mei, I've already paid the bills.

143
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:53,920
Take care of your mother.

144
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,600
Thank you, Mr. Ye.

145
00:08:55,712 --> 00:08:57,200
Please talk some sense into Xiaotang.

146
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,480
The Lu family is vile.

147
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,000
She can't marry into it.

148
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,320
Lu Qingyuan is totally heartless.

149
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,320
Don't worry.

150
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,720
Xiaotang can handle it.

151
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,600
Everyone wants to play a role?

152
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,040
Fine.

153
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:17,400
Then I'll put on an unforgettable show
with all of you.

154
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,280
(Infinite reset.)

155
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:25,360
(Turns out heaven gave me
the ultimate weapon for revenge.)

156
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,080
(Since I can't get rid of it,)

157
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,240
(I might as well take it.)

158
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,840
(I'll turn every single loop)

159
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:34,360
(into your personal nightmare.)

160
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:38,360
(The game has only just begun.)

161
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,720
Gu Xiaotang.

162
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,800
You haven't had
that rib removal surgery yet.

163
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:48,000
Your waist is as thick as a barrel.

164
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:52,040
If you look bad in photos
and can't make headlines,

165
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,920
what are you going to do?

166
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,600
Headlines?

167
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,080
You want to make headlines?

168
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:14,800
Are you crazy?

169
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,200
What are you doing?

170
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,400
Ready to make headlines?

171
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,680
What's going on?

172
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:50,680
What happened?

173
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:56,600
Xia Na, why did you push me?

174
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,720
I didn't!

175
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,400
- I didn't push her!
- Isn't that Gu Xiaotang?

176
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,160
- Stop it!
- Film it!

177
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,600
- Stop it!
- Hurry, film it!

178
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,760
I-I feel so dizzy.

179
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,160
Stop filming!

180
00:11:16,752 --> 00:11:17,752
(Emergency Room)

181
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,480
- Hurry!
- Director Zhang!

182
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,080
Director Zhang!

183
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,920
- Mr. Lu.
- What happened?

184
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:24,920
She...

185
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,680
Save her at all costs.

186
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:29,160
- Do you hear me?
- Yes.

187
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:31,480
- Go now!
- Lu Qingyuan, she's faking it.

188
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,680
I didn't even touch her.

189
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:36,200
Shut up! You useless waste!

190
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,120
If anything happens to her kidney,

191
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,600
you're dead.

192
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:42,067
(Nurse Station)

193
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,640
The patient is bleeding out
and needs a transfusion.

194
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,080
We are currently out of Type O.

195
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,440
Are you Type O?

196
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,200
You are Type O, no?

197
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,200
I can't! I'm afraid of needles.

198
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:54,400
Come on!
Drawing some blood won't kill you!

199
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,600
Go now.

200
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:44,920
Mr. Lu, the test results are in.

201
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,080
Miss Gu is fine.

202
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:49,000
- But...
- But what?

203
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,440
You asked me to check Miss Gu's kidney.

204
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,080
The results show

205
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:59,160
hers isn't a match for your mother's.

206
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,200
The data is accurate.

207
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:03,120
(Kidney Match Test Report)
Did we make a mistake last time?

208
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:08,160
However, we ran a preliminary screening
on Ms. Xia Na, who just donated blood.

209
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:11,040
She is a near-perfect match.

210
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:50,256
♪The face deep in the heart♪

211
00:13:50,448 --> 00:13:52,910
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

212
00:13:54,285 --> 00:13:57,985
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

213
00:13:58,196 --> 00:14:00,636
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

214
00:14:00,783 --> 00:14:03,155
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

215
00:14:03,305 --> 00:14:06,062
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

216
00:14:06,062 --> 00:14:08,383
♪Even for just a second♪

217
00:14:09,728 --> 00:14:13,191
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

218
00:14:13,319 --> 00:14:15,168
♪And sunlight reverses♪

219
00:14:15,168 --> 00:14:18,638
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

220
00:14:18,994 --> 00:14:21,068
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

221
00:14:21,570 --> 00:14:24,979
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

222
00:14:25,236 --> 00:14:30,448
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

223
00:14:31,702 --> 00:14:34,267
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

224
00:14:34,309 --> 00:14:37,762
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

225
00:14:38,339 --> 00:14:41,302
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

226
00:14:42,047 --> 00:14:44,655
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

227
00:14:44,655 --> 00:14:48,278
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

228
00:14:48,748 --> 00:14:52,804
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
